# The account the --privsep analyzer runs as (probolos.service passes
# --privsep-user probolos).
#
# Its own account, not the shared `nobody`. Any process may signal, ptrace or
# replace the files of another process with its uid, so under `nobody` every
# other `nobody` process could kill the analyzer (the gate then reopened every
# hub) or take over the agent socket. Nothing else runs as `probolos`.
#
# A system user and group, no home, no login shell, password locked.
# install.sh copies this file to /etc/sysusers.d/probolos.conf; a package
# ships it as /usr/lib/sysusers.d/probolos.conf.
u probolos - "Probolos USB analyzer" - -
